### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### 1. Create an order (happy path)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-001",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "prod-abc", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 19.99 },
    { "productId": "prod-xyz", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 49.50 }
  ]
}

### 2. Create an order with invalid input (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "",
  "items": []
}

### 3. Get an order by ID
# Replace {{orderId}} below with a real ID returned from request #1
@orderId = 2027f50f-b56c-4b2d-89cd-ef372a15e04b

GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### 4. Get an order that does not exist (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 5. Get order history
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/history

### 6. Get history for a nonexistent order (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/history

### 7. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health